WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:15.180
Maxie: That's Benny.

2
00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:17.981
Taco: Who is Benny?

3
00:00:17.982 --> 00:00:22.735
Maxie: He is my brother. Hi, Benny!

4
00:00:22.736 --> 00:00:24.848
Benny: Who is this?

5
00:00:24.849 --> 00:00:27.960
Maxie: This is my friend Taco.

6
00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:33.798
Benny: It's nice to meet you.

7
00:00:33.799 --> 00:00:37.069
Taco: Wh . . . who . . . who is that?

8
00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.335
Benny: That's Smiley.

9
00:00:39.336 --> 00:00:44.722
Maxie: And that's his sister Happy.

10
00:00:44.723 --> 00:00:55.192
Benny: Hurry, Maxie!

11
00:00:55.193 --> 00:01:00.104
Maxie: Whew! That was close!
